This book contains pictures of savagely looking people in loincloths. According to it, this island's inhabitants are quite savage people. They live in small tribes. They know what the fire is, but can't make it. Each tribe carries fire in a wicker and worships it like an idol. The loss of fire is a great misfortune for those people. They communicate mainly by gestures. 
You keep turning the pages over, but soon it makes you bored. You may need to look for something else.